        "text_eqLHrN": {
          "type": "text",
          "name": "t:names.text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Wine shipping in the United States is regulated state by state. We hold permits for the states listed below and cannot ship outside them.</p><p><br/>We currently ship to:<br/><br/>Arizona (AZ) · California (CA) · Connecticut (CT) · Florida (FL) · Georgia (GA) · Louisiana (LA) · Nebraska (NE) · New Hampshire (NH) · New Jersey (NJ) · New Mexico (NM) · New York (NY) · North Dakota (ND) ·Ohio (OH) Oregon (OR) · South Carolina (SC) · Nevada (NV) · Texas (TX) · Virginia (VA) · Washington, D.C. (DC) · West Virginia (WV) · Wyoming (WY)<br/><br/><br/>Age verification: All shipments require an adult signature from someone 21 or older at delivery. We cannot leave wine unattended.</p><p>Local restrictions: Some counties and municipalities prohibit alcohol delivery even in permitted states. If your address falls in one of these areas, we'll contact you and issue a full refund. Not in a state we ship to? Visit us at any Open Container location, or contact us about local pickup.<br/><br/><br/>Warm weather: From June through September, we may hold shipments or upgrade to expedited service to protect your wine.</p><p>Questions? haik@opencontainerwine.com · </p><p>(689) 263-2252<br/><br/></p>",
